                    <h3>Worked as Registrar of Aryabhatta Knowledge University and invited as expert committee member/Resource person in Govt. and Non-Govt. organizations.</h3>
                    <div class="acnn-cv-body">
<p>Dr. Rakesh Kr Singh, worked as Registrar of Aryabhatta Knowledge University Patna from 8th Jan 2022 to 31st December 2022, demonstrates various commitment to academic administration and organizational devolvement including as post-sanctioned of 7 new schools including Stem cell science, School of Astronomy and AstroPhysics. He has also Worked/ invited as expert committee member/Resource person in different academic programme by BCST-DST, Govt. of Bihar, Sri Krishna Science centre, Ministry of culture, Govt. of, State Council of Educational research and Training (SCERT) Dept. of Education Govt. of Bihar, IIT Kanpur, NIT Patna, BIT Patna, IIT Patna, Colleges/Universities/Schools in different district of Bihar/India. Dr. Rakesh worked as peer review member/Editor of more than 25 SCI/Scopus/Peer review Journals, published from USA, UK and European Countries/India/China/Japan.</p>
